# Page CSS selectors (packages/demo-styles/src/pages) allowed to reach into registry classes.
# Format: page-folder<TAB>selector, sorted (LC_ALL=C). Checked in CI by tools/fidelity/registry-selectors.py --check.
# Adding a line: list the class in react/packages/deep-ink/PUBLIC-CSS.md in the same PR; the reviewer must justify it.
